  "2026-07-26T22:05:51.733Z","harness:claude-code","GH mapping: this item is the tracker record for GitHub issue 743 (pm test: schema sandbox breaks package prepare hooks that run pm merge install). The title predates the GH-<n> prefix convention; the mapping is recorded here rather than by retitling so search on either spelling resolves."
  "2026-07-27T10:05:44.311Z","harness:codex","Evidence: implementation is complete; pnpm lint passed with zero jscpd clones, static/docstring/SDK compatibility gates passed, 375 files and 6,404 tests passed at 100/100/100/100 coverage, and an unrelated packed consumer resolved its local executable then passed install/doctor/create/list plus npx and bunx version smoke tests."
  "2026-07-27T11:12:40.349Z","harness:codex","PR #769 review evidence: explicit CLI tracker selection now wins over protected linked-source environment fallback and resolves the target tracker owning Git repository; absent explicit selection retains safe source fallback. Focused merge-safety coverage passed."
